{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0069","paragraphs":[{"id":"p0520586250d4-1","text":"漠漠轻寒上小楼。"},{"id":"pd9fae3397cf2-1","text":"晓阴无赖似穷秋。"},{"id":"pc9815406691e-1","text":"淡烟流水画屏幽。"},{"id":"pc8f007b08f46-1","text":"自在飞花轻似梦，无边丝雨细如愁。"},{"id":"p3e25dbfd4bc8-1","text":"宝帘闲挂小银钩。"}]}